<title>POLAND: Ocean Q2 net rises to PLN 0.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Ocean Q2 net rises to PLN 0.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ocean preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 1.68 vs	1.10</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   1.32 vs	1.13</p>
<p>    net profit				 0.82 vs	0.67</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Ocean Company SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 17.55 vs     12.29</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  13.87 vs	7.42</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		     na vs	  na</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.50 vs	0.47</p>
<p>    other taxes				  na vs	  na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.06 vs	2.91</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.42 vs	2.88</p>
<p>    investment				 0.87 vs	0.85</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 2.49 vs	1.50</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   1.82 vs	1.57</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.11 vs	0.91</p>
<p>    net sales				 25.44 vs     18.36</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  19.13 vs     13.49</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		     na vs	0.02 loss</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.71 vs	0.66</p>
<p>    other taxes				  na vs	  na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.66 vs	5.43</p>
<p>    financial costs			  1.33 vs	5.34</p>
<p>    investment				 1.31 vs	1.11</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
